    {
      "source": "Implementations will typically create <a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePropertySource</code></a>\ninstances, with <a href=\"PropertySourceProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PropertySourceProcessor</code></a> automatically adapting\nproperty source names via <a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html#withResourceName()\"><code>ResourcePropertySource.withResourceName()</code></a>\nif necessary, for example, when combining multiple sources for the same name\ninto a <a href=\"../../env/CompositePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>CompositePropertySource</code></a>.\nCustom implementations with custom <a href=\"../../env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a> types need\nto make sure to expose distinct enough names, possibly deriving from\n<a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePropertySource</code></a> where possible.",
      "translation": "实现通常会创建 `<a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePropertySource</code></a>` 实例，并在必要时通过 `<a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html#withResourceName()\"><code>ResourcePropertySource.withResourceName()</code></a>` 自动调整属性源名称（例如，当将多个同名源合并为 `<a href=\"../../env/CompositePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>CompositePropertySource</code></a>` 时），由 `<a href=\"PropertySourceProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PropertySourceProcessor</code></a>` 处理。具有自定义 `<a href=\"../../env/PropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertySource</code></a>` 类型的自定义实现需要确保暴露足够独特的名称，在可能的情况下从 `<a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePropertySource</code></a>` 派生。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation for <a href=\"PropertySourceFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>PropertySourceFactory</code></a>,\nwrapping every resource in a <a href=\"ResourcePropertySource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>ResourcePropertySource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`PropertySourceFactory` 接口的默认实现将每个资源包装在 `ResourcePropertySource` 中。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
