      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"PropertySourceFactory.html#createPropertySource(java.lang.String,org.springframework.core.io.support.EncodedResource)\">PropertySourceFactory</a></code></span>",
